<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ACILIA TRAIN STATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Acilia Train Station is a major railway station located in Acilia, a suburb of Rome, Italy, operated by Aeroflot since 2010."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acilia train station is a transportation facility operated by Cotral, playing a crucial role in public transport in the Lazio region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AEROFLOT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aeroflot is the flag carrier of Russia and has operated Acilia Train Station since 2010, managing its day-to-day operations through its subsidiary, Aeroflot Rail."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rome is the city where Acilia Train Station is located, and it is part of the Lazio region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Italy is the country where Acilia Train Station is located, and it is part of the Lazio region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AEROFLOT RAIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aeroflot Rail is the subsidiary of Aeroflot responsible for managing the day-to-day operations of Acilia Train Station."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COTRAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cotral is an organization responsible for operating Acilia train station and committed to improving public transport in the Lazio region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cotral is the region's premier public transport company that has taken over the operation of Acilia Train Station, aiming to enhance the travel experience for commuters."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA ROSSI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Rossi is the CEO of Cotral and has expressed her commitment to providing top-notch services to passengers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAYOR OF ACILIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Mayor of Acilia has expressed confidence in the partnership between Cotral and Acilia Train Station, expecting positive impacts on the local economy and quality of life."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAZIO REGION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lazio region is the area where Acilia train station operates and where improvements in public transport are targeted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lazio region is where Acilia Train Station is located, and it has seen a significant increase in population growth, with over 5.8 million residents relying on public transport."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISTAT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ISTAT is the Italian National Institute of Statistics, which has provided data on the population growth in the Lazio region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMUTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Commuters are the users of Acilia Train Station, who rely on the station for travel and are expected to benefit from the improved services."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERMINI STATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Termini Station is a major railway station in Rome, connected to Acilia Train Station by frequent trains."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC TRANSPORT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public transport refers to the various modes of transportation available in the Lazio region, with Acilia Train Station serving as a vital hub."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECURITY MEASURES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Security measures are part of the improvements expected under the new operation by Cotral."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MODERNIZED INFRASTRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Modernized infrastructure is another aspect of the improvements expected under the new operation by Cotral."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FREQUENCY OF TRAINS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Frequency of trains is expected to increase under the new operation by Cotral."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL ECONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local economy refers to the economic benefits expected from the improved services at Acilia Train Station."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUALITY OF LIFE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quality of life is expected to improve for residents of Acilia due to the new operation by Cotral."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASSENGERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Passengers are the beneficiaries of the improved travel experience and are at the center of Cotral's operational objectives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0182</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;ACILIA TRAIN STATION&quot;" target="&quot;AEROFLOT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Aeroflot has operated Acilia Train Station since 2010, managing its day-to-day operations through its subsidiary, Aeroflot Rail."</data>
      <data key="d5">"operation, management"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACILIA TRAIN STATION&quot;" target="&quot;COTRAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cotral has taken over the operation of Acilia Train Station, aiming to enhance the travel experience for commuters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cotral operates Acilia train station and is committed to enhancing public transport in the Lazio region."</data>
      <data key="d5">"new operation, improvement"&lt;SEP&gt;"operation, improvement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACILIA TRAIN STATION&quot;" target="&quot;AEROFLOT RAIL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Aeroflot Rail is responsible for managing the day-to-day operations of Acilia Train Station."</data>
      <data key="d5">"management, responsibility"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACILIA TRAIN STATION&quot;" target="&quot;MAYOR OF ACILIA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Mayor of Acilia has expressed confidence in the partnership between Cotral and Acilia Train Station, expecting positive impacts on the local economy and quality of life."</data>
      <data key="d5">"support, expectation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACILIA TRAIN STATION&quot;" target="&quot;LAZIO REGION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">23.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acilia Train Station serves as a vital hub for residents and visitors in the Lazio region, catering to the growing demand for public transport."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acilia train station serves the Lazio region, contributing to the overall public transport network in the area."</data>
      <data key="d5">"hub, service"&lt;SEP&gt;"service area, regional impact"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACILIA TRAIN STATION&quot;" target="&quot;PASSENGERS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acilia train station provides a convenient travel experience for passengers, serving as a key transportation hub in the Lazio region."</data>
      <data key="d5">"travel experience, passenger satisfaction"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;COTRAL&quot;" target="&quot;DR. MARIA ROSSI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Maria Rossi is the CEO of Cotral and has expressed her commitment to providing top-notch services to passengers."</data>
      <data key="d5">"leadership, commitment"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;COTRAL&quot;" target="&quot;PASSENGERS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cotral aims to provide a convenient travel experience for passengers, highlighting their focus on customer satisfaction."</data>
      <data key="d5">"customer focus, service quality"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0182</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
